<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  A diecast car in side view, in the adaptive icon's 108dp canvas, shifted up so it sits centred.
  The whole car stays inside the 66dp safe zone that every launcher mask (circle, squircle...) keeps.
  Windows, wheel arches and the gap around the hubs are holes, not painted in the background
  colour, so this drawable also works as the themed-icon monochrome layer.
-->
